  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_Upgrade_Message2:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠ ᏙᏢᎯᏒ ᎡᎷᏊ ᎪᎯᏓ ᏯᎭᎵᏓ ᎠᎴ ᏣᏤᎵ PC ᏯᏂᎩ. Ꮭ ᏱᎦᎲᏂᏓ PC ᎬᏂᎩᎳ ᏳᎵᏍᏆᏓ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_Upgrade_Message1:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᏙᏢᎯᏒᎯᏍᏗᎲ ᎪᏪᎵ ᎪᏪᎳᏅ ᎠᏤ ᎦᏴᎸᏍᎨᏍᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏄᏍᏛ Ꮎ Windows. Ꮟ ᏂᏣᎴᏅᏓ, ᎤᏙᎯᏳ ᎠᎵᏏᏂᏓ ᏗᏣᎶᏫᏍᏓᏁᎸᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎯᏍᏚᎲᎦ ᏂᎦᎥ ᏧᏍᏗ ᏗᎬᏂᏗ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_Upgrade_Button_Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: hᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏙᏢᎯᏒᎢ
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_UNKNOWN_ERROR_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎣᎩᏄᎸᎲᏍᎩ ᎣᎦᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ Windows ᎥᎿ ᎬᏙᏗ ᏃᏊ ᎨᏒᎢ. ᏯᏁᎵᏓ ᎭᏂᎩᏍᏗᎲ ᏞᎩᏴ ᎠᎴᏱᎩ ᏫᎷᎩ Store ᏣᏩᎯᏍᏗ ᎤᏙᎯᏳ Windows.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_UNACTIVATED_DOWNLEVEL_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎦᏟᏌᏅ ᎦᎴᏴᏔᏅ ᎾᏍᎩ Windows  ᏓᏤᏞᏍᏗ ᏅᎦ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ-ᎤᏂᎩᏍᏔᏅ ᏄᏓᎴᏒᎢ Windows. ᎰᏩᏊ ᎠᏴᏍᏓ ᎤᏙᎯᏳᎢ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᏍᏚᎢᏍᏓ, ᎠᎴ ᎮᎾ Store ᎠᏩᎯᏍᏗ ᎧᎵᏬᎯ Windows.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_Troubleshooter_ActionDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᏂᏣᎵᏍᏓᏁ Ꮎ ᎭᏂᎩᏍᏗᎲᎢ, ᎠᏑᏰᎦ ᎣᏍᏓᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᏛᏛᎮᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᏣᏁᎵᏙᏗ ᎣᏍᏓ ᏅᏁᎲ Ꮎ ᏥᏂᎦᎵᏍᏓᏂᏙᎯ. 
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_TroubleshooterDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎣᏍᏓᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᏛᏛᎮᎸᎥᏍᎩ
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_TOKEN_ERROR:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows ᎥᏝ ᏱᎬᏩᏘ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏩᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ.  ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᎦᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎤᏩᏘᏅᏗᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏂᎸᎩ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᏍᎩᏃᎩᎳ ᎬᏩᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ Windows. 
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_TokenErrorDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows ᎥᏝ ᏱᎬᏩᏘ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏩᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ.  ᎦᏘᏅᏗᏍᏗ ᏗᏓᏂᎸᎩ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᎭᏂ PC ᎠᎴ ᏣᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏄᏍᏗ ᏓᏅᎢ ᎤᎦᏎᏍᏗᎦᎩ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_TOKEN:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows ᎥᏝ ᏱᎬᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎾᏊ ᎨᏒ. ᎪᎯᏴᎢ ᏏᏊ ᎢᎭᏁᏟᏔᏅᎢ ᏣᏂ ᎩᏍᏙᏗᎢ.  ᎢᏳᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎸᎾ ᏱᎩ, ᎢᏳᏃ ᎥᏍᎩ ᏂᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎸᎾ.  ᏱᎩ, ᏩᏟᏃᎮᏙᏗ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏄᏍᏗ ᏓᏅᎢ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_TIMEBOMB_EXPIRING_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ꮎ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏓᎪᎵᏰᏍᎩ ᎸᏓᏚᏒᎢ Ꮎ Windows ᎠᎵᏍᏆᏗᏍᎨᏍᏗ ᏞᎩᏱ. ᎯᏗᏅᏛ ᎠᏤ ᎸᏓᏚᏒᎢ Ꮎ Windows ᎠᎴ ᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ. ᎬᏂᎩᎳ ᏱᏣᏂᎩᏍᏓᎾ, ᎯᎠ PC ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎨᏍᏗ ᏂᎪᎸ ᏔᎵ ᎠᏟᎵᏏᎥᎢ, ᎢᎭᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_TIMEBASED_EXPIRED_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠᎾ ᎸᏓᏚᏒᎢ Windows ᎦᏳᎳ ᎤᎵᏨᏅᎢ. ᎯᏘᏅᏛᎦ Ꮎ ᎠᏤᎢ ᎸᏓᏚᏒᎢ ᎤᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_SupportActivateInstructions_Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎯᎩ ᎠᏍᏕᎸᏗᎢ ᎠᎴᏱᎩ ᏗᏟᏃᎮᏗᎢ
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_SubscriptionExpiredRejuv:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Your %1 subscription has expired—contact your organization’s admin for help.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_SubscriptionExpired:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: %1 ᎠᏓᏅᏢ Ꮭ ᏚᏴᏛᏱᎩ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_SubscriptionActive:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: %1 ᎠᏓᏅᏙᏗ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏓ
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_Store_Entitlement:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows is activated with a digital license.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_SOFTMOD_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᏕᎫᏓᎸ PC ᏓᎨᏳᏗᎭ ᎤᏂᎩᏍᏗᎢ. ᎪᏤ ᏣᏩᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎢᏣᏗᏅᏙᏗ ᎠᏤ ᎸᏓᏚᏒᎢ Windows.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_SAFE_MODE_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎦᏂᏰᎬᎾ ᏚᎶᏫᏍᏓᏁ Windows. ᎢᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏥᎨᏐᎢ Windows ᎦᏟᏏᎰ ᎦᎵᎶᎬ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏗᏍᎩ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_REBOOT_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows ᎠᏩᏔ ᎤᏓᏁᏟᏴᏒᎢ ᎥᎿ ᏄᏍᏗᏓᏅᎢ ᏓᏒᎥᎥᏂᎪᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎠᎵᏍᏚᏗᎭ ᎬᏩᏂᎩᏍᏙᎢ. ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ Windows ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏴᏂᎩᏍᏓ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_PhoneActivate_ActionDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᏍᎩᏴᏓᏁᎸᎩ ᎣᎦᏂ ᎩᏍᏙᏗᎢ Windows.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_PhoneActivateDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᏝᏃᎮᏗ ᎬᏗ ᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_OpenResolutionURLDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎤᏩᏍᎩ ᎦᎫᏍᏛᏙᏗ ᎯᏟᏃᎮᏓ
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_ONLINE_ERROR:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows ᎤᏄᎸᎲᎦ ᎤᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ. ᎡᎭᏁᎳᏓᏅᎥ ᏞᎩᏴᎢ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_OEM_SLP_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎦᏳᎳᏍ Windows ᎦᎳᏅ ᎢᎨᏎᏍᏗ, ᎨᎯᏯᏗ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᎸᏍᏗᏜᏅᎢ ᎠᏃᏢᏍᎦ ᎠᎴ ᏱᎩ ᎤᏃᏢᏅᎲᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_OEM_OOT_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏓᏓᎴᎦ ᎥᏂ ᎩᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ. ᏩᏟᏃᎮᏤᏗᏃ Ꮎ ᎤᏬᏢᏅᎢ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ PC.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_NO_PRODUCT_KEY_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎥᎧᏃᏉᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ Windows.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_NO_KEY_FOUND:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏄᏩᏁᎴ ᎾᏍᎩ Ꮭ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎠᏂᏩᏔ ᎥᎿ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎪᎷᏩᏘᏍᎩ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_NoPKeyFound:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ꮭ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎠᏩᏛᏗᏱᎩ
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_NEVER_ACTIVATED_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎥᎧᏃᏉᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ Windows.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_NETWORK_UNAVAILABLE_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ꮭ ᏲᏣᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎯᎠ Windows ᎥᎿ ᎬᏙᏗ, Ꮎ ᎣᎦᏤᎵ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᏛᏁ Ꮭ ᏳᏜᏅᏓ ᏃᏊ ᎨᏒᎢ. ᎤᏙᎯᏳ ᏫᏧᏓᎴᏍᏗ ᎥᎿ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏲᏣᏁᎵᏓ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ Windows ᎾᎯᏳ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ᎤᏓᏜᏅᏕᏍᏗ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LICENSE_EXPIRING_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏣᏤᎫ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎬᏙᏗ Windows ᏞᎩ ᎠᎵᏍᏆᏗᏍᎨᏍᏗ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LEARN_MORE:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎤᏟᎢ ᎤᎪᏓ ᎠᏓᏃᎯᏎ
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LearnMore_AccessibleName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Learn more about Windows activation
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LaunchAltClient_NotDefined_ErrorMessage:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Activation client is not defined. Please contact system administrator.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LaunchAltClient_LaunchFailed_ErrorMessage:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Activation client failed to launch. Please contact system administrator.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LaunchAltClient_ErrorMessage:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Something went wrong. Try again later.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LaunchAltClient_Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Launch activation client
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LastKeyError:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ꮎ ᎣᏂ ᎦᏅᏗᏅᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ (ID: %1) ᏥᏴᏍᏙᏗᏝ ᏱᎬᎪᏓ ᎥᎿᎯᎠ ᎦᎴᏅᏓᏅᎢ Ꮎ Windows. (0x%2!X!)
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_KMS_NOT_FOUND:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎣᎩᏄᎸᎲᏍᎩ ᎣᎦᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ Windows ᎥᎿ ᎬᏙᏗ, Ꮭ ᏱᎬᏣᏚᎸᎦ ᎥᎿ ᏣᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ ᎢᏯᏂᏛᏁᏗᎢ. ᎣᏍᏓ ᏣᎦᏛᎲᎦ ᏱᏧᏓᎵ ᎥᎿ ᏣᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏣᎭᏁᎵᏓ. Ꮟ ᏱᏣᏄᎸᎲᏍᎦ ᎭᏂᎩᏍᏗᎲᎢ, ᏫᏃᎯᏏ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏣᏓᏡᎬ ᏣᎫᏍᏛᏍᎩ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_INVALID_PRODUCT_KEY_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ꮭ ᏲᏣᏂᎩᏍᏓ Windows ᎥᎿ ᎬᏙᏗ Ꮎ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᏣᏴᏍᏓᏅ Ꮭ ᎣᏍᏓ ᏱᎩ. ᏫᎷᎩ Ꮎ Store ᏣᏩᎯᏍᏗ ᎤᏙᎯᏳ ᎨᏒᎢ Windows.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_IDS_TIMEBOMB_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ꮎ ᎠᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᎠᏓᎪᎵᏰᏍᎩ ᎸᏓᏚᏒᎢ Windows ᎦᏳᎳ ᎤᎵᏨᏅᎢ. ᎡᎯᏘᏅᏛᎦ ᎠᏤ ᎸᏓᏚᏒᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ. ᎬᏂᎩᎳ ᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓᏅ, ᎯᎠ PC ᎠᏂᎩᏍᎨᏍᏗ ᏂᎪᎸ ᏔᎵ ᎠᏟᎵᏏᎥᎢ, ᎢᎭᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_IDS_HARDWARE_OOT_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ꮭ ᏲᏣᏂᎩᏍᏓ Windows ᎥᎿ ᎬᏙᏗ Ꮎ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᏣᏳᏍᏓᏅ Ꮭ ᏱᏓᏙᎵᎦ Ꮎ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ. ᏞᎩᏴ ᎣᏍᏓ ᏱᏂᏨᏁᎴ Ꮎ Windows ᎠᎴᏱᎩ ᎤᏙᎯᏳ ᏱᏣᏁᏟᏴᏎ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᎥᎿ ᎬᏙᏗ, ᎭᏑᏰᎦ ᎣᏍᏓᏱᎬᏁᏓ ᎠᏛᏛᎮᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᎠᎴ ᏣᎭᏁᎵᏓ ᎠᎴ ᎣᏍᏓ ᏅᎦ Ꮎ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏓᏂᏙᎲᎢ. ᏫᎷᎩ Ꮎ Store ᏗᏣᏩᎯᏍᏗ ᎤᏙᎯᏳ ᏗᎨᏒ Windows.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_IA_HOST_NOT_ACTIVATED_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows Ꮭ ᏱᎬᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏓnᏙ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎪᏢᏍᎩ. ᎤᏙᎯᏳ Ꮎ ᎠᏓᏁᏢᏍᎩ  ᎪᏢᏍᎩ  ᎤᏂᎩᏓ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏣᎭᏁᎳᏓ. 
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_IA_GENERIC_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows ᎤᏄᎸᎲᎦ ᎤᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗᎢ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏓᏅᏙ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᎰᏢᏅᏙᏗ. ᎭᏁᏟᏓ ᏄᏓᎴᎢ ᏣᏙᏗᎢ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ, ᎢᏳᏃ ᏂᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎸᎾ ᏱᎩ, ᎡᎵ ᏓᏤᏢᎢ ᏱᏨᏁᏗ ᏱᎩ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎠᏓᏁᏢᏍᎩ ᎪᏢᏅᏙᏗ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_HARDWARE_ID_CHANGED:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏄᏩᏁᎴ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏍᏓᏯ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᎾᎿ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_GetHelpActivate_Description:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎩᎶ ᏣᏍᏕᎳ
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_GEO_BLOCKED_CONTENT:
